{"id":"ilusio_n","lemma":"ilusión","pos":"noun","rank":2735,"glosses":["illusion","hope, expectation","enthusiasm"],"ipa":"/iluˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ilusiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ilusi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La vida es una ilusión.","en":"Life is a delusion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636656","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"the game"]]},{"text":"¿Todo fue una ilusión?","en":"Was it all an illusion?","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"No te hagas ilusiones.","en":"Don't get any ideas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586912","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]},{"text":"Estoy esperando la fiesta con ilusión.","en":"I'm looking forward to the party.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/557493","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"party"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Me encanta hacerme ilusiones.","en":"I just like to daydream.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460689","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to charm, to enchant","l":"encantar"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]}]}